menu "Smart blinds read-only gauge continuity bench adapter"
config BLINDS_GAUGE_CONTINUITY_BENCH
    bool "Permit explicitly qualified read-only gauge attachment"
    depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32C6
    default n
    help
        Compile-time bench gate only. The experimental motion runtime also
        requires an explicit local handoff qualification before attachment.
        Attachment also requires explicit boot-bound pack/continuity records.
        It cannot create a bus, write a register or approve physical actuation.
endmenu
